{"id":"ce4e118c6e5c010c","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-pi01-perfect-cardinality.md","title":"无可计算成员的非空有效闭类有连续统大小","display":"thm-pi01-perfect-cardinality — 无可计算成员的非空有效闭类有连续统大小","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-pi01-perfect-cardinality","aliases":["43-thm-pi01-perfect-cardinality"],"display":"thm-pi01-perfect-cardinality — 无可计算成员的非空有效闭类有连续统大小","depends_on":["[[43-df-pi01class]]","[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-thm-finite-pi01]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Corollary 5.16.5, print p.63 / PDF p.83","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-pi01-perfect-cardinality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-pi01-perfect-cardinality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pi01-perfect-cardinality — 无可计算成员的非空有效闭类有连续统大小"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" href=\"?note=cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" title=\"43-df-pi01class\">43-df-pi01class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3990b21717529194\" href=\"?note=3990b21717529194\" title=\"43-thm-finite-pi01\">43-thm-finite-pi01</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Corollary 5.16.5, print p.63 / PDF p.83"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}\">\\(\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Computable}\">\\(\\operatorname{Computable}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" href=\"?note=cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" title=\"43-df-pi01class\">43-df-pi01class</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathcal C\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathcal C\\ \\neg\\operatorname{Computable}(X)\\Rightarrow|\\mathcal C|=2^{\\aleph_0}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathcal C\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathcal C\\ \\neg\\operatorname{Computable}(X)\\Rightarrow|\\mathcal C|=2^{\\aleph_0}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若存在孤立路径，则如有限类证明可计算；因此每个可延伸节点都可继续分裂，构造二叉完美子树给连续统个不同路径。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 5.16.5, print p.63 / PDF p.83。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-pi01class","status":"resolved","id":"cc07cf2b9ec0019e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pi01class]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-finite-pi01","status":"resolved","id":"3990b21717529194","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-finite-pi01]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pi01class","status":"resolved","id":"cc07cf2b9ec0019e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}$、$\\operatorname{Computable}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-pi01class]]、[[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}$、$\\operatorname{Computable}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-pi01class]]、[[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Computable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathcal C\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathcal C\\ \\neg\\operatorname{Computable}(X)\\Rightarrow|\\mathcal C|=2^{\\aleph_0}.","display":true}],"bytes":1276,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-pi01-perfect-cardinality]] — 无可计算成员的非空有效闭类有连续统大小"}],"outgoing":["cc07cf2b9ec0019e","f357216a7edb035a","3990b21717529194"]}